msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The light shining in through the windows is swallowed whole by the darkness,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그때 드리웠을 빛은―― 도로 어둠에 잠겨 ⟪k:2⟫사라져 있었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9A429384_63EF_448F_BB1E_187BA0AE1A0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
