msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m begging you, please remember.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Please find yourself."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫부디―― 떠올려 주십시오.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫자기 자신을…… 되찾아 주십시오."

#: scenario5:scenario5_70B9AAF8_7F17_4513_9716_A53F203F1B52
