msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫틀림없는―― ⟪k:3⟫그대와 저의 기억입니다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F5C8388C_2585_4615_9F61_450612C5FDFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2e78da493a1b8336a0ac4df7f92692855d1b23e8a048340506b8bae76f22f94
