msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had never encountered Michel’s brothers while at his family’s estate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……내가 친가 저택에 있었을 때는 ⟪k:1⟫미셸의 형들을 만나진 못 했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F237594D_9E48_4DC3_98F6_FB45C98AB6BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 555af37aed9d1847d2d9ea984f16a9cbbefe7abaf697f9b70e95d4cb382fa846
