msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F237594D_9E48_4DC3_98F6_FB45C98AB6BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But assuming he was right and it was one of them who had given me that letter, they were "
"likely our only allies at that house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫나에게 편지를 보낸 게 ⟪k:2⟫미셸의 형이라면, ⟪k:3⟫친가 안에서도 ⟪k:4⟫형들만이 미"
"셸 편을 들었을 것이다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_913D6AFA_9829_4FAB_925E_2C845ED7201F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e693d984d5d9bb8b2d2cd34b3819a677713e607e9064a34ef8bc3e85cbe916b
#. default-sha256: 6f1580bae4eedcb875649207edf7b8992e09f466de31a5dcd3fea14c00ab89a4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_913D6AFA_9829_4FAB_925E_2C845ED7201F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I don’t know what he’s thinking. It’s been ten years,”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Michel had muttered, ⟪k:3⟫"
"to which I had replied, ⟪k:4⟫“Have faith.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫10년이란 시간이 지난 지금, ⟪k:1⟫미셸은 「이젠 형이 무슨 생각인지 모르겠다」고 했는데――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2584C624_1FCF_439F_9EB2_11669D77B571
