msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Yeah. You sit across from each other, put your elbow on the table,⟪k:3⟫grab hands, "
"and see who can pin the other down."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫맞아요, ⟪k:3⟫탁자 위에 팔꿈치를 두고 ⟪k:4⟫힘을 겨루는 거죠. ⟪k:5⟫손등이 먼저 탁자"
"에 닿은 사람이 지는 거예요."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2B45F5D5_EB6C_46B7_8E54_614134CFCB42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27288dc4680e0968ebab9f641750340e04b0fd5b03c3debc6be5655b5b0c5a74
