msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Not interested, then?⟪k:3⟫Or are you ⟪k:4⟫afraid you might lose⟪k:5⟫?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫어머, ⟪k:3⟫싫으세요? ⟪k:4⟫혹시 지는 게 무서우세요?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1323B818_8014_43C0_8F40_80B0EE07D706
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b3c966865a7800213cfc1183ce60baa582ad60f81106791474799b5a9949ca1
