msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫..................⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫All right, then.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I can’t imagine losing to a woman."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………………해 봅시다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫아무리 그래도 ⟪k:4⟫여자 팔에 질 것 같진 않거든요."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A0FDFA7F_D048_4F47_AB59_8773FD1E811D
