msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehehe. Okay, elbow on the table.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Start on my count."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫우후후. ⟪k:3⟫그럼 ⟪k:4⟫팔꿈치를 대 주세요. ⟪k:5⟫하나 둘 셋 하면 시작해요."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F19CC288_C958_4E9D_B974_FCF88CA4138C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
