msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Victory!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫이겼다~!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7045E095_A2DC_4D1B_8492_79DB806D8D59
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 000fb55413a8aa22f9157b9ff9b2ed7d50da8804ec157964a386490ce13f28b5
#. default-sha256: cbbb10d528f996f0bb7c0b7c66df351a2446ae6f573448cd37531e95ceef00da
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7045E095_A2DC_4D1B_8492_79DB806D8D59"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫With each passing day, it grew less and less unusual having someone—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫having "
"Giselle always at my side."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫날이 갈수록 ⟪k:2⟫내 곁에 타인이―― 지젤이 있는 게 ⟪k:3⟫이상하지 않아졌다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2788F6E5_C238_49D9_81AF_4858FA6B1D2A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd81eb02bb8ff6bab27526426388eafad9e4443d8e0da3e63f7637b124b52a25
#. default-sha256: 9ea5b20e4bfe38379b2c846474e0ee9be8b56f129b8c5f3ef449a58c459e6967
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2788F6E5_C238_49D9_81AF_4858FA6B1D2A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I began more freely engaging in silliness,⟪k:1⟫speaking my mind, and showing emotion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫유치한 짓을 하고, ⟪k:1⟫생각한 걸 말로 하며, ⟪k:2⟫감정을 드러내는 게 자연스러워졌다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_7B0A813D_3CF6_4E09_8CF9_C6958D74F552
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6ececfdd946aeaa94839e5f42769d0e59ec49af3d8c4280409c23f0e0d0e990
#. default-sha256: 707eb5a0a9bc1248a9ab76b5ddcac1831a9e73759066292bbccd8a8631d54568
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7B0A813D_3CF6_4E09_8CF9_C6958D74F552"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I could say her name, and Giselle would turn around and smile at me—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫an "
"unimaginable sight not long ago."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫말을 걸면 ⟪k:1⟫지젤이 당연한 것처럼 나를 돌아보았다. ⟪k:2⟫예전 나 같으면 ⟪k:3⟫비현실적인 광경"
"이었을 텐데."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D2D3E4B4_AF5A_4A7E_8452_2AD1969D8682
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b4fa61362788b3f08a78f8d4f9f621ee56bc9d3b6bfb7475bc9caa2d66b06c8a
#. default-sha256: 24cb06e491b96dcd3c9774a7ebe52dc0e689235be85186df07f87e365638929b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D2D3E4B4_AF5A_4A7E_8452_2AD1969D8682"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For ten years... ⟪k:1⟫For ten years I had lived alone.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Solitude had been my "
"“normal,”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그렇다, ⟪k:1⟫10년――, ⟪k:2⟫10년을 넘게 혼자 지냈기에, ⟪k:3⟫그게 당연해졌을 텐데……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5E8C2B19_5343_4ECB_BD87_4DBFB03E941B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19722215274cb39f2a28daf885c91f243d7b53a926fa59ace031940be5462270
#. default-sha256: ff936e37515614f9743d7d015651ad9a16dd958a7f086899ba54f7dfbce993e8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5E8C2B19_5343_4ECB_BD87_4DBFB03E941B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but that was very rapidly changing at her hands."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내 당연하던 일상은 ⟪k:1⟫지젤에 의해 ⟪k:2⟫빠른 속도로 바뀌어 갔다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DB658B29_049B_4803_AC45_F3AB72BB4AED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d89bd55ad1169f2cf67a7e76c30d3d1025c7de3be5dfe1f4202ff727ea84879
#. default-sha256: 6830f4a508dd87a99a83897fb3a6fd7f4dd3a8f857872d8fd44fa393ccfdfcfd
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DB658B29_049B_4803_AC45_F3AB72BB4AED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We were continually getting closer, yes, but not in a romantic sense."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……나와 지젤의 거리는 ⟪k:1⟫확실하게 가까워졌다. ⟪k:2⟫하지만 그건 ⟪k:3⟫연인 같은 관계가 아니다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B93F8ECB_4FBE_4DE7_A74F_0AE23F60E4C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f219df58c12cfdc061088c595b3a90ef166c8c04136425727cdb88ef4c57d58e
#. default-sha256: c6cc20a5845ed158eb76f41ac223533464626f7fa1207329e627c15d8266aeb6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B93F8ECB_4FBE_4DE7_A74F_0AE23F60E4C3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I had to describe it, I would say “good friends” was probably the most apt. ⟪k:1⟫Time "
"continued to press on, our relationship remaining relatively stable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫단어로 표현하자면 ⟪k:1⟫친구란 관계가 ⟪k:2⟫가장 부합할 것이다. ⟪k:3⟫그 관계가 변치 않는 채로"
"―― 시간이 흘렀다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_456F1BD3_2A33_48B2_8B6B_DA8C337576F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a17810f4e7d1a2540c85c7dbbc0d6ebe52727f4c62ac6da0cf5d30fc4c3ba91c
#. default-sha256: 82bd32f61871e938f70cf71bda4de196515b688cd3b040d0041de74b4029ef69
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_456F1BD3_2A33_48B2_8B6B_DA8C337576F1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eventually, summer came, bringing with it the longest periods of sunlight I had experienced "
"in many years. ⟪k:1⟫Then, the leaves began falling from the trees, and before long, the world "
"grew cold and dreary."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫여름이 찾아와 ⟪k:1⟫아주 오랜만에 해가 긴 계절을 보았다. ⟪k:2⟫어느덧 낙엽이 떨어지는 계절이 되"
"었고, ⟪k:3⟫살을 에는 추위가 드리웠다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D3609512_D91D_4932_8F85_593F0102A1AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e4419fdc02d17877670f2c3ff0d35b5adbb8bdbd73d4328470dede465be5a7e
#. default-sha256: 4100df60c08438ec929fd718b6068105b036de18c18582e796c4f06c8d4eb0c3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D3609512_D91D_4932_8F85_593F0102A1AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That winter, the fireplace was never without a crackling blaze in its belly. ⟪k:1⟫The boiled "
"wine we drank was undoubtedly middling and cheap,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫난롯불은 ⟪k:1⟫꺼지는 일이 없었다. ⟪k:2⟫데운 와인은 ⟪k:3⟫질 낮은 것이었겠지만――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3E33F8FD_DBFD_4A8F_897B_7C6E3336E250
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9796521d4248a99fa89d8d38a11c91fea776229dfbed5c90dd0a027562fc1b88
#. default-sha256: 21bc7759ce9ce8e1c4ef8e0431a0ab21a43d5142dc8b4d2adfd5af8884f9f241
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3E33F8FD_DBFD_4A8F_897B_7C6E3336E250"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but she said, with a smile, ⟪k:1⟫“I’ve never had wine this good before.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And though "
"I didn’t say anything, I felt the same way."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫지젤은 「이렇게 맛있는 와인은 처음 마셔 본다」며 웃었고, ⟪k:1⟫나도 ⟪k:2⟫말로 하진 않았어도 같"
"은 마음이었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F41DBBF2_2AA4_4DC4_9DD7_D9310B3D9D50
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4b750e8f1d9333a9c0e08ab5370def1d162cb000b308da006eaf3160523941a
#. default-sha256: a65413bfd986df6166fa577df777b980bc5a4e93efe8cc3d56725e43a8aa0ad2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F41DBBF2_2AA4_4DC4_9DD7_D9310B3D9D50"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sun set much earlier, and having stopped using candles, we found ourselves habitually "
"gathering around the fireplace when it grew dark."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫겨울은 해가 짧다. ⟪k:1⟫촛불을 의지하지 않기 시작한 우리는 ⟪k:2⟫자연스럽게 ⟪k:3⟫늘 난로 앞에 "
"있었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_E86A0C07_5355_4383_B9EF_8545CF914C5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b2947f12859f7b6ee9dc156bb9cf142e4eeb0c7248f54dee031e91ce751e3b4
#. default-sha256: b252084f3d65890ff05c67bf89a98a9fffc2a07bb041ad23e65dd25e0c2db020
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E86A0C07_5355_4383_B9EF_8545CF914C5F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Reading a story by the fireplace like this almost "
"makes it feel like we’re in another world, doesn’t it, Master?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫저기, ⟪k:9⟫주인님. ⟪k:10⟫이렇게 난로 앞에서 이야기를 "
"읽으면―― ⟪k:11⟫왠지 다른 세계로 떠나는 것 같지 않나요?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_87A4D858_6B93_4DCE_A0F3_080F9C5FA81C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f68a5a048f6eced56f49296564a0cce8489ee6a36dfcc6ae8860c05d227c751
