msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_87A4D858_6B93_4DCE_A0F3_080F9C5FA81C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9FB03DE8_0D5D_4717_8FB2_F44670EFEC03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: babefa0493f30df6449d694cbba2236cdb170f142b23aae62d45902beaff347f
#. default-sha256: ae00d39c7f8cbe5fbbe2a8a41c4f48afdc72c0e16a76105badaf44bc5ee5b142
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9FB03DE8_0D5D_4717_8FB2_F44670EFEC03"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I bet that’s why troubadours perform at pubs—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫so they can be near the fire."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫음유시인이 주점에서 노래하는 건 ⟪k:1⟫역시 난로가 가까이 있어서 그런 걸까요."

